msgid "A modern front-end for 7-Zip on GNOME"
msgstr ""

#: data/top.akizip.akizip.metainfo.xml.in:10
msgid ""
"Akizip is a graphical archive utility built with GTK 4 and libadwaita that "
"brings the power of 7-Zip to the GNOME desktop. It supports creating and "
"extracting archives in a wide range of formats, including 7z, ZIP, TAR, "
"GZIP, and RAR (read-only)."
msgstr ""

#: data/top.akizip.akizip.metainfo.xml.in:11
msgid ""
"Features include archive inspection, cancellable background jobs with "
"progress reporting, a dedicated logs panel, and multilingual support."
msgstr ""

